Wildlife conservation license plates-
SF0149
amendments.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Pappas and Representative(s) Brown, L
AN ACT relating to motor vehicles; authorizing county treasurers to accept
applications and payment for wildlife conservation license plates; amending
application requirements; requiring rulemaking; and providing for effective
dates.
